  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">교사의 하루는&#160;<br>수업을 계획하고,<br>수업을 실행하고<br>수업&amp;학습을 피드백하는 시간으로 채워져야 합니다.<br>&#160;<br>하지만 학교의 현실은...<br>수업에만 전념할 수가 없네요.<br>&#160;<br>수업은<br>학교의 과중한 업무 중의 일부이고,<br>잠깐 교과서 읽어보고 교실에 들어가는 상황도 발생합니다.<br>&#160;<br>그래서&#160;<br>5분 만에&#160;<br>수업을 준비할 수 있을까? 라는 문제의식으로<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&#39;하루살이 교사를 위한 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&#160;수업준비 AI 생성기 앱&#39;</span></b>을 만들었습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2181deea0ba81faea424cb319f053f00f65ede2e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2181deea0ba81faea424cb319f053f00f65ede2e\" data-origin-width=\"511\" data-origin-height=\"790\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">이번 시간에 수업을 할 교과서 페이지를 캡쳐하여 Ctrl+V 합니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 82.893%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 41.6981%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8f3edb93536e6fe87e596fbf2e1d09475b763cd\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"298\" height=\"362\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8f3edb93536e6fe87e596fbf2e1d09475b763cd\" data-origin-width=\"622\" data-origin-height=\"755\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 41.195%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47e1703b00513597bacaf6153d7c67661940b882\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"294\" height=\"359\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47e1703b00513597bacaf6153d7c67661940b882\" data-origin-width=\"643\" data-origin-height=\"786\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>그럼 아래와 같은 수업지도안이 생성됩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4991c40dde3fa420fc25fe17624a0ab8173bb98\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4991c40dde3fa420fc25fe17624a0ab8173bb98\" data-origin-width=\"620\" data-origin-height=\"709\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">수업지도안과 학습지를&#160;<br>한글 파일로 다운받습니다~</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/354c68e79904f83e39b4278b6311ef7d2ccc690b?download\" data-file-name=\"생명 과학의 발달 과정_수업지도안_및_활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"62464\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D1020%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20260927174744&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F354c68e79904f83e39b4278b6311ef7d2ccc690b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">생명 과학의 발달 과정_수업지도안_및_활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">61.00KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>사용해보시고,<br>피드백 주시면 계속 업그레이드 하겠습니다~<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://share.gemini.google/n4asvgaOFnBF\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://share.gemini.google/n4asvgaOFnBF</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"&#8206;Gemini - Lesson Plan Generator Web Application\" data-og-description=\"Gemini로 생성됨\" data-og-host=\"gemini.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://share.gemini.google/n4asvgaOFnBF\" data-og-url=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/769d354fa318\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.ne